{
    "background_story": "Westley was a charismatic entrepreneur with a passion for revolutionizing the way people moved around cities. Growing up in a congested metropolis, he experienced firsthand the frustration of traffic jams and overcrowded public transport. Determined to make a difference, Westley founded a company that developed sleek, high-tech hoverbikes designed for efficient and sustainable transportation. His innovative designs quickly gained popularity, and soon his hoverbikes were zipping through the skies, reducing congestion and emissions. Westley's vision for a faster, cleaner, and more enjoyable transport system transformed the urban landscape, earning him accolades as a pioneer in the field. His company expanded to develop hyperloops and self-driving cars, further solidifying his reputation as a visionary in the transport industry.",
